# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# tdgl-simulator
#
# Git applies the LAST matching pattern, so every "keep this" rule (!) lives in
# the KEEP section at the bottom -- after the broad *.pdf / *.png / *.txt rules
# it has to override. A negation placed higher up in this file will not work.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Python environment ----------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- simulation output -----------------------------------------------------
data/
data_*/

# binary field dumps (psi.bin, vec_pot.bin, Js.bin, Jn.bin, phi.bin,
# div_Js.bin, Jtot.bin, power.bin)
*.bin

# numeric array dumps
*.npy
*.npz
*.h5
*.mat

# HPC sweep results (grid_task*.txt, grid_k*_task*.txt) -- thousands of files
*.txt

# --- compiled Fortran ------------------------------------------------------
# Linux executables have no extension, so they are listed by exact path.
# These must match the -o name in docs/build-environment.md and the binary
# that each sweeps/*/*.sh actually runs.
app/tdgl
sweeps/curr_vs_hp/sweep_curr_hp
sweeps/curr_vs_w0/sweep_curr_w0
sweeps/hp_vs_kappa_vs_size/sweep_hp_kappa_size

# build artifacts
*.o
*.mod
*.smod
*.a
*.exe

# --- cluster job logs ------------------------------------------------------
*.out
*.err
slurm-*.out

# --- figures and video -----------------------------------------------------
# Code-only repo: figures are regenerated by the scripts in figures/.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.svg
*.eps
*.pdf
*.gif
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mov

# --- OS cruft --------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ===========================================================================
# KEEP -- these override everything above. Order matters: this block must stay
# below the broad rules, and the LaTeX artifact block must stay below it.
# ===========================================================================

# the Python pin
!requirements.txt

# everything under docs/: the .tex source, references.bib, the built PDF,
# photos/ used by \includegraphics, and the .md notes
!docs/**

# --- LaTeX build artifacts -------------------------------------------------
# Re-ignored after !docs/**, so a local latexmk run leaves nothing to commit.
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb
